      "name": "Why Brisa Helps",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "",
        "liquid": "<div class=\"three-column-grid fw-white-bg\" style=\"\nborder-top: 10px solid #008bdc;\nborder-left: 10px solid #008bdc;\nborder-right: 10px solid #008bdc;\npadding-bottom: 0px;\n\">\n<div class=\"grid-column\" style=\"padding: 0px; \">\n<img src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/brisa-packs.png?v=1775142199\" style=\"position: relative; top: -50px; transform: rotate(180deg);\">\n    \n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid-column\" style=\"padding-left: var(--container-gutter); \">\n<a class=\"home_button\" style=\"background: #ff0000\" >ALREADY HAVE A BRISA?</a>\n    <h3 class=\"heading h2\">GRAB YOUR CORE REFILLS HERE.</h3>\n    <p>Kits are sold out, we have enough cores to supply our already brisa customers, refill here:.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid-column\" style=\"text-align: right; padding: 0px; \">\n<img src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/brisa-packs.png?v=1775142199\" style=\"position: relative; top: -50px\">\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"fw-white-bg\" style=\"\nborder-left: 10px solid #008bdc;\nborder-right: 10px solid #008bdc;\npadding-bottom: 0px;\n\">\n  <div  class=\"container\" style=\"max-width: 800px\">\n\n<div class=\"option\">\n<div class=\"title\">\nOption 1\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\nDM us @Brisabetter.au to create a custom pack, and we will send you details there. to get it shipped out that day\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"option\">\n<div class=\"title\">\nOption 2 - Direct Transfer\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\nEMAIL BANK TRANSFER (DIRECT)\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub_option\" style=\"background: #ace6ff55\">\n<div class=\"left\">\n<div>3 Pack — MINT ICE</div>\nOur best performing\n</div>\n<div class=\"right\">\n$45\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub_option\">\n<div class=\"left\">\n<div>6 Pack — BLACKCURRENT</div>\nLess longevity\n</div>\n<div class=\"right\">\n$45\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub_option\">\n<div class=\"left\">\n<div>6 Pack — WATERMELON</div>\nLess Longevity\n</div>\n<div class=\"right\">\n$45\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px\"><b>How to pay</b></div>\n<div class=\"instructions\">\n<div class=\"grey\">\nEmail us: admin@brisabetter.com</div>\n<div>( Your Full Name ) - CORES -  </div>\n<div>( Pack & Flavour )</div>\n<div>( Your Address )</div>\n\n<div>\n<span class=\"grey\">\nExample: \n</span>\nJohn Smith - CORES -<br>\n6 Pack Watermelon<br>\n7 Smith street Carlton 3053 VIC\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"sub_option\" style=\"background: #ace6ff55\" style=\"margin-top: 25px\">\n\n<div class=\"text\">\nWe will then reply with an invoice.\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #008bdc; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 20px;\">\n\n<a class=\"home_button\" style=\"background: #ffffff; color: black;\" >Drop 2.0</a>\n<h2 style=\"color: white; text-align: center; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 48px\">BIGGER.<br>\nBETTER.<br>\nMORE VALUE.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"tick\">\n  <div>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/tick.png?v=1777733230\" style=\"max-width: 30px\">\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    Large kit restock (more available this time).\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tick\">\n  <div>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/tick.png?v=1777733230\" style=\"max-width: 30px\">\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    More value and more options releasing.\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tick\">\n  <div>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/tick.png?v=1777733230\" style=\"max-width: 30px\">\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    New flavours coming.\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tick\">\n  <div>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/tick.png?v=1777733230\" style=\"max-width: 30px\">\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    Brisa Subscription cores will also be coming so you new run out.\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<style>\n.sub_option .left div {\nfont-weight: bold;\n}\n.tick {\nfont-weight: bold;\ncolor: white;\ntext-align: left;\nline-height: 1.3;\nmax-width: 550px;\nmargin: 8px auto;\nfont-size: 13px;\ndisplay: flex;\nalign-items: center;\n\n}\n.tick img {\nmargin-right: 10px;\n}\n.sub_option {\n  background: rgb(171 230 255);\n  border: 2px solid #008bdc;\n  margin-top: 13px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  display: flex;\n  \n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n}\n.sub_option .right {\nfont-weight: bold;\ncolor: #008bdc;\nfont-size: 200%;\n}\n.instructions {\nbackground: #333;\nborder-radius: 10px;\npadding: 15px;\ncolor: white;\ntext-align: left;\nline-height: 1.4;\n}\n.instructions .grey {\ncolor: #aaa;\nfont-weight: bold;\n}\n</style>",
